{{define "content"}}
<section class="project-token-page">
<h1>{{.AccessProjectToken.Name}} 的项目令牌</h1>
<p>令牌只显示这一次，离开本页后不能再查看。</p>
<div class="token-block">
<p><strong>项目令牌</strong></p>
<code id="project-token-value" class="token-value">{{.AccessProjectToken.Token}}</code>
<button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy-target="project-token-value">复制令牌</button>
</div>
<div class="token-block">
<p><strong>.mcp.json 片段</strong></p>
<pre id="project-snippet-value" class="token-snippet"><code>{{.AccessProjectToken.Snippet}}</code></pre>
<button type="button" class="copy-button" data-copy-target="project-snippet-value">复制片段</button>
</div>
<p class="token-warning">不要把含令牌的文件提交进 git。</p>
<p><a href="/ui/access/projects">回到项目令牌列表</a></p>
</section>
{{end}}
